#ASSERT `Article 11 — the refund on the revocation of the registration on` (YMD 2026 7 2) `under` (`a one-year contract concluded on` (YMD 2026 1 1) `for` `a private car`) EQUALS RIGHT (437000 TIMES 183 DIVIDED BY 365)
#ASSERT `Article 11 — the refund on the revocation of the registration on` (YMD 2026 1 1) `under` (`a one-year contract concluded on` (YMD 2026 1 1) `for` `a private car`) EQUALS RIGHT 437000
#ASSERT `Article 11 — the refund on the revocation of the registration on` (YMD 2027 1 1) `under` (`a one-year contract concluded on` (YMD 2026 1 1) `for` `a private car`) EQUALS RIGHT 0
#ASSERT `Article 11 — the refund on the revocation of the registration on` (YMD 2027 1 2) `under` (`a one-year contract concluded on` (YMD 2026 1 1) `for` `a private car`) EQUALS LEFT `the day of revocation is outside the term of the insurance`

§§ `Article 12(2) — 1 hour and 24 hours`

